### ls output into a file named rm
ls > rm
>>> SC2238 1:6

### reading from a file called cat
sort < cat
>>> SC2238 1:8

### appending to a file called grep
date >> grep
>>> SC2238 1:9

### quoted rm target is intentional
ls > 'rm'
>>> none

### ordinary file name
ls > inventory.txt
>>> none

### the word file is excluded
ls > file
>>> none
